  "notes": {
    "title": "Music, starter upgrades and Arena flow",
    "summary": "The Dream Library and all five dungeons have their own music. Arena runs now show your route on a live star map, and skill offers give more builds a chance to come together.",
    "changes": [
      "Set separate Master, Music and Sound effects volumes in Settings. The mixer remembers your choices across restarts.",
      "Added eight modifiers across Bleeding Cut, Double Slash, Bulwark and Frost Grasp. Owned modifiers stay inactive until their required base skill is available.",
      "Skill offers use build fit as a weight. The Actives and Passives pages show the theme mix for each offer pool.",
      "Newly picked cooldown skills slot in before spenders while preserving the order of existing skills. Arena level transitions continue automatically when there is no reward decision.",
      "The star map follows the seeded Arena route and scrolls to the current encounter. Added Luna dialogue and updated Arena effects."
    ]
  }
}